  "details": "I am not saying give these assets for free, but I would like it if you could add support for some of these custom culling solutions so we could better optimize our world.\n\nThe problem with occlusion culling is that for Large Maps, it is impossible to do occlusion culling well enough to make the world fit on Mobile Devices like Quest. With these solutions we may be able to bake our culling whilst not having it make a world go from 25 mb download to 71 mb or even 150 mb download for a large-scale world.\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/package/272830\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/package/193611\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/package/184023\n\nThanks,\n\nFTTristan!",
